# РЇС‡РµР№РєР° (Bay): OrganisationRole РѕР±РѕСЂСѓРґРѕРІР°РЅРёСЏ СЏС‡РµР№РєРё
[r500:
	  (?bay so:Object.OwnersToTop ?organisation) <-
	  (?bay rdf:type cim:Bay)
	  (?bay cim:EquipmentContainer.Equipments ?eq)
	  (?eq rf:IdentifiedObject.OrganisationRoles ?orgRoles)
	  (?orgRoles rdf:type cim:AssetOwner)
	  (?orgRoles cim:OrganisationRole.Organisation ?organisation)
	  noValue(?bay so:Object.OwnersToBottom ?organisation)
      noValue(?bay so:Object.OwnersToTop ?organisation)
      noValue(?bay so:Object.DataSourceToBottom  ?organisation)
      noValue(?bay so:Object.DataSourceToTop  ?organisation)
]

